<Layout
  titleOverride="Building Construction Company in Faizabad Road, Lucknow | VP Infra"
  description="Building Construction Company in Faizabad Road, Lucknow by VP Infra. ISO 9001:2015 certified residential, commercial and turnkey construction. Request a quote."
>
  {schemas.map((s) => <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(s)} />)}
  <section class="page-header text-center" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.8), rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.8)), url('/images/locations/commercial-complex-construction-lucknow.webp');">
  <div class="container"><h1 class="fade-in-up">Building Construction Company in Faizabad Road, Lucknow</h1><p class="fade-in-up mt-4">Showrooms, offices, apartments and commercial buildings on Faizabad Road, designed for visibility and easy access.</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-details" data-words="main">
  <div class="container"><div class="grid gap-8 service-grid">
  <div class="service-content fade-in-up">
  <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Road-Facing Construction Along Faizabad Road</h2>
  <p class="mb-4 snapshot" data-snap="1">VP Infra is a building construction company on Faizabad Road, Lucknow, that builds showrooms, offices, apartments and mixed-use buildings. We design for frontage, parking and fire safety, and deliver under ISO 9001:2015 procedures with a clear schedule and structural supervision.</p>
  <p class="mb-4">Faizabad Road is one of the main commercial corridors in the city, and the traffic that makes it valuable also makes building on it demanding. A showroom here lives or dies on visibility and parking. An office block needs safe entry, exit and parking for staff and visitors. We start by studying how people and vehicles will reach your building, then shape the structure around that.</p>
  <div class="mt-8"><a href="/contact-us" class="btn btn-primary">Start Your Project</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="service-image fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;"><img src="/images/locations/commercial-complex-construction-lucknow.webp" alt="Building construction company on Faizabad Road, Lucknow: commercial showroom building under construction" width="1024" height="1024" loading="eager"></div>
  </div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="alt-section" data-words="main">
  <div class="container">
  <h2 class="section-title">What We Build in Faizabad Road</h2>
  <div class="loc-intro"><p class="snapshot" style="text-align:left" data-snap="1">Our building construction services in Faizabad Road, Lucknow, cover houses, rental floors, commercial buildings and turnkey projects. Each service below comes with one written scope, one schedule and one team, so you know what is being built, by when and at what cost.</p></div>
  <div class="grid gap-8 build-grid">
  <div class="card fade-in-up"><div class="card-content"><h3 class="card-title">Showrooms</h3><p class="card-text">Double-height frontages, glass facades and display floors that draw drivers in.</p></div></div>
  <div class="card fade-in-up"><div class="card-content"><h3 class="card-title">Apartment Buildings</h3><p class="card-text">Multi-storey blocks with lift cores, stilt parking and fire exits on busy road-side plots.</p></div></div>
  <div class="card fade-in-up"><div class="card-content"><h3 class="card-title">Mixed-Use Buildings</h3><p class="card-text">Shops below and flats or offices above, with separate entries and parking planned early.</p></div></div>
  <div class="card fade-in-up"><div class="card-content"><h3 class="card-title">Office Buildings</h3><p class="card-text">Flexible floor plates, lift cores and parking sized for the building's use.</p></div></div>
  </div>
  </div>
  </section>

  <section data-words="main">
  <div class="container loc-text">
  <h2 class="section-title">Frontage, Setbacks and Parking on Faizabad Road</h2>
  <p class="mb-4 snapshot" data-snap="1">Buildings on a main road carry stricter setback and parking rules than interior plots. These rules decide how much of the plot you can build on, so understanding them before design avoids losing floor area at the sanction stage. This avoids surprises at the sanction stage.</p>
  <p class="mb-4">We calculate permitted coverage, height and parking before the first sketch. For commercial buildings, parking can take up a stilt floor or a basement, and a basement means dewatering, waterproofing and ramp design. Buildings taller than 15 metres need a Fire NOC, which we plan for from the start. We also design entrances so vehicles slow and turn inside your plot, not on the road outside.</p>
  <div class="nearby"><p>We also build in nearby areas:</p><div class="area-links"><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-indira-nagar-lucknow/">Building Construction in Indira Nagar</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-chinhat-lucknow/">Building Construction in Chinhat</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-gomti-nagar-lucknow/">Building Construction in Gomti Nagar</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-jankipuram-lucknow/">Building Construction in Jankipuram</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-lucknow/">Building Construction Company in Lucknow</a></div></div>
  </div>
  </section>

  <section class="alt-section" data-words="main">
  <div class="container">
  <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
  <div class="faq-list">
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>Which building construction company serves Faizabad Road, Lucknow?</h3><p>V.P. Infra Properties (OPC) Private Limited is an ISO 9001:2015 certified contractor serving Faizabad Road. We build showrooms, offices, apartments and mixed-use buildings. Call 8840069902 to book a site visit and request a written scope and estimate for your plot. Faizabad Road plots vary, so we visit before quoting.</p></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>Do you build showrooms and offices on Faizabad Road?</h3><p>Yes. We design for frontage, customer parking and service access, along with the fire safety these buildings require. Each project begins with a review of the plot, the sanction limits and the way your customers will actually reach you from the road.</p></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>What approvals does a commercial building on Faizabad Road need?</h3><p>Commercial buildings need a sanctioned map from the Lucknow Development Authority, and buildings taller than 15 metres need a Fire NOC. Larger projects may need RERA registration. We prepare the technical drawings and documents for each step of the process.</p></div>
  </div>
  </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-banner" data-words="main">
  <div class="container">
  <h2>Plan Your Faizabad Road Building With VP Infra</h2>
  <p>Tell us your plot size and what you want to build. We will visit, assess the site and send a written estimate.</p>
  <a href="/contact-us" class="btn btn-primary">Get a Quote</a>
  <p class="phone">Call or WhatsApp 8840069902</p>
  </div>
  </section>

  <section>
  <div class="container text-center">
  <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:1.8rem">Other Areas We Serve in Lucknow</h2>
  <div class="area-links"><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-gomti-nagar-lucknow/">Gomti Nagar</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-gomti-nagar-extension-lucknow/">Gomti Nagar Extension</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-hazratganj-lucknow/">Hazratganj</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-aliganj-lucknow/">Aliganj</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-indira-nagar-lucknow/">Indira Nagar</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-mahanagar-lucknow/">Mahanagar</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-jankipuram-lucknow/">Jankipuram</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-ashiyana-lucknow/">Ashiyana</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-alambagh-lucknow/">Alambagh</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-rajajipuram-lucknow/">Rajajipuram</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-chinhat-lucknow/">Chinhat</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-sultanpur-road-lucknow/">Sultanpur Road</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-shaheed-path-lucknow/">Shaheed Path</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-kanpur-road-lucknow/">Kanpur Road</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-vrindavan-yojana-lucknow/">Vrindavan Yojana</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-sushant-golf-city-lucknow/">Sushant Golf City</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-krishna-nagar-lucknow/">Krishna Nagar</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-amausi-lucknow/">Amausi</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-sitapur-road-lucknow/">Sitapur Road</a></div>
  </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
